# GS-006: Capture carbon dioxide and release the same carbon again
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaOH 0.002mol
seal v1 500mL
add v1 CO2 0.001mol
inspect v1
measure v1 pressure
add v1 HCl 0.003mol
inspect v1
measure v1 pressure
inspect
